/S /H4
/P 105 0 R
/T (To configure user management and role-based access control \(RBAC\) within the Bank Loan Application Form application built in Zoho Creator, by creating permission sets, constructing a role hierarchy, and configuring a custom data-sharing rule that grants the loan officer role Read/Write access to loan application data owned by the applicant role.)
/E (To configure user management and role-based access control \(RBAC\) within the Bank Loan Application Form application built in Zoho Creator, by creating permission sets, constructing a role hierarchy, and configuring a custom data-sharing rule that grants the loan officer role Read/Write access to loan application data owned by the applicant role.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
