571 0 obj
<<
/Title (The experiment demonstrated how permissions, roles, role hierarchy and data sharing together form a role-based access control mechanism in Zoho Creator. Structured forms and a role-aware dashboard replace the paper forms and verbal requests of a manual bank counter with clean, consistent, and analysable data. The two-level hierarchy and the directional Read/Write share rule keep information channels controlled: the loan officer gains exactly the access needed to review and process applicant loan applications, while the CEO retains overall oversight and the applicant, Guarantor, and Auditor roles continue to own their respective records. The result is a secure, auditable and scalable access-control framework for the Bank Loan Application Form application.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 486 0 R
>>
endobj
